{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "dataset_version": "fia-grade1-2026-03-31+f1-2020-2026",
  "description": "Canonical physical venues: union of the FIA Grade 1 licensed circuit list (updated 31 March 2026) and every venue that hosted a Formula 1 Grand Prix from 2020 onwards. Multiple configurations at the same physical venue are collapsed into one routing venue.",
  "source": {
    "authority": "Fédération Internationale de l'Automobile (FIA)",
    "licensed_circuits_updated": "2026-03-31",
    "publication_date": "2026-04-16",
    "document": "List of FIA Licensed Circuits",
    "url": "https://www.fia.com/sites/default/files/circuits_fia20260331_0.pdf"
  },
  "notes": [
    "fia_license_grade and fia_license_expiry are derived from the FIA Grade 1 list.",
    "Coordinates, city names, IANA timezones, regions, and f1_current_2026 are enrichment fields for EcoRace Planner.",
    "FIA Grade 1 status does not imply inclusion on the 2026 Formula 1 sporting calendar.",
    "This file models physical venues for routing; FIA-listed alternate configurations are not separate routing nodes.",
    "Phase 0 amendment: the two Dubai Autodrome configurations (Grand Prix + International, identical coordinates) are collapsed into a single dubai_autodrome routing venue.",
    "Phase 0 amendment: zandvoort fia_license_expiry was not transmitted (truncated source); set to null pending verification against the FIA PDF.",
    "F1-calendar extension: entries carrying f1_hosted_seasons hosted an F1 Grand Prix in those seasons (2020-2026) but were absent from the transmitted Grade 1 list; their fia_license_grade/expiry are null (not certified by the transmitted source, not a claim about the real world). venue_source marks provenance: fia_grade1 vs f1_calendar.",
    "F1-calendar extension sources: FIA/FOM 2026 calendar announcement 2026-06-10 (Madrid debut, Imola dropped); Madring coordinates 40.46528N 3.61528W (IFEMA, Barajas).",
    "Data verification 2026-09-17: Madring received final FIA approval for F1 competition on 2026-06-23 and hosted the inaugural Spanish GP 2026-09-11/13 (FIA race report). madring fia_license_grade set to 1 accordingly; expiry still unverified (null). venue_source stays f1_calendar (absent from transmitted March Grade 1 list). zandvoort expiry still pending PDF verification."
  ],
